+actual coefficient u=W*z: the checker requires u^(q+1)=1 and
+u^((q+1)/3) != 1.  For these paper parameters, Section 3's criterion then makes
+
+    f(X) = X^d + u*X,       d={d},
+
+a permutation of F (and u^(-1) X^d a complete permutation monomial).
+
